4e]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev2 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the FileSystem panel, dragging a script to or from a folder, shows the error message:\n\n> ERROR: Another resource is loaded from path 'res://a/new_script.gd' (possible cyclic resource inclusion).\n\nReordering the script shows the error message every time.\n\nThe same error message is reported here:\nAnother resource is loaded from path (possible cyclic resource inclusion). #116551\n\nBut that issue describes having to create and remove an exported resource multiple times to cause the error.\n> Check console output logs -- sometimes the error is difficult to reproduce.\nAfter anywhere from 5 to 20 tries you should see the error.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open the project: [error-when-reordering-script.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25822800/error-when-reordering-script.zip)\n- in the filesystem panel\ndrag `new_script.gd` to the folder: `a`\n- a dialog opens:\n> Please Confirm...\nMove 1 selected item to \"res://a\"?\n- click: ok\n- open the output panel\n\nIssue:\nThe output panel shows:\n>   ERROR: Another resource is loaded from path 'res://a/new_script.gd' (possible cyclic resource inclusion).\n\nThe same error appears when dragging the script from the folder `a` to `res://`\n>  ERROR: Another resource is loaded from path 'res://new_script.gd' (possible cyclic resource inclusion).\n\n\nExpected:\nNo error message when reordering a script.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[error-when-reordering-script.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25822800/error-when-reordering-script.zip)\n\nIt's just a new project with:\n- a folder, named: a\n- an empty script: new_script.gd","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117211/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117211/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}